  "description": "This secluded, generously proportioned two-bedroom own door duplex apartment brings nature home with landscaped gardens at your doorstep.  Entering through your private staircase and welcoming terrace, your peaceful surrounds defy your central urban location within a short hop to the city.\n \nSunlight flows through each interior, creating a bright and comfortable living space, which includes a dedicated workspace and high-quality fit-out, highlighting the impressive design detail and finish.\n \nKing size beds and fitted wardrobes with full-length mirrors and plush furnishings give you the space you deserve. Both bedrooms have the advantage of spacious ensuites, stunning views and a private top floor terrace. \n \nThe kitchen is ideal for entertaining with a beautiful dining area, separate utility room and WC room, stylish slimline worktops and integrated appliances, striking an impressive tone in this culinary space. \n \nOne tour of this apartment highlights creativity and innovation – all you could possibly want is right where you want it, just waiting to be enjoyed.\n(show apartment in advert - soft furnishings etc not included)",
